=== in map key (1)
DIM m AS MAP OF STRING
m.put("name", "Alice")
m.put("city", "Berlin")
PRINT "name" IN m
PRINT "city" IN m
PRINT "unknown" IN m
--- erwartet
TRUE
TRUE
FALSE

=== in map key (2)
DIM m AS MAP OF STRING
m.put("name", "Alice")
m.put("city", "Berlin")
